summary:
  A station is listened to while the question what its stream is still
  stands.

history:
  Both are connections to the station beside the player's own. Measured on
  one that limits them: five inside a second were answered 429 and the
  station stayed silent.

target:
  package/contents/ui/Loudness.qml

find:
          if (kind && kind.busy) { settle.restart(); return; }

replace:
          if (kind && kind.busy) { settle.restart(); }

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_the_question_what_the_stream_is_goes_first.
  Line-neutral.
